<title>UK: Norway's Kvaerner nine month pretax profits slide.</title>
<headline>Norway's Kvaerner nine month pretax profits slide.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian shipbuilder and engineering group Kvaerner ASA said on Monday that pretax profits slipped to 851 million Norwegian crowns for the nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>The company said this compared with 1.9 billion crowns for the same period in 1995. Analysts' forecasts had centred on pre-tax profits of around 847 million crowns.</p>
</text>
